[0.008, "o", "chy—ICD-O-3\u001b[81Gconditions\u001b[92Glinked\u001b[99Gto\u001b[102Gtopography\u001b[113GC18.2,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band co\u001b[10Gcepts with finding site \"Ascending colon structure\"—plus a morphology\u001b[80Gcross-check\u001b[92Gcomparing\u001b[102GSNOMED\u001b[109Gmorphology\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bagainst\u001b[11GICD-O-3\u001b[19Gbehaviour\u001b[29Gcodes.\u001b[36GNext\u001b[41GI'll\u001b[46Grun\u001b[50Gthese\u001b[56Genumerations\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gvalidate\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Gmatches.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mCalled groundworkers \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m times \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mconcept_neighbors\u001b[21G\u001b[39monly follows\u001b[34Gedges in one direc\u001b[53Gion, so I'\u001b[64Gl pull the t\u001b[77Gpography and anatomy concepts' full\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brelationship lists instead.\u001b[K\r\u001b[30C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[39mI found 210 ICD-O-3 conditi\u001b[31Gn\u001b[34Gvia the t\u001b[44Gpography r\u001b[55Gute at C18.2 and 234 concepts via the anatomy rou\u001b[105Ge (\u001b[109Ginding\u001b[116Gsite:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAscendi\u001b[11Gg colon structure)\u001b[31GNow\u001b[35GI'll\u001b[40Gcross-reference\u001b[56Gboth\u001b[61Gsets\u001b[66Gagainst\u001b[74Gthe"]
